  "$comment": "The one SynaBun Browser Bridge this app release works with (docs/browser-extension-bridge.md -> Where the extension comes from). The app downloads exactly this file when the owner presses \"Connect your browser\" and installs it only when its size and SHA-256 are these. files is the SHA-256 of every file in it (the manifest with its setup content script set to port 1): the folder the browser loads counts as this extension only when it holds exactly these files. version, url, sha256, size and files are written by `node scripts/extension/check-browser-extension-pin.mjs --write` from the zip built out of browser-extension/ (Dev only); never edit them by hand. key is the extension's public key (its manifest's `key`): the extension ID is derived from it and never changes.",
